Z||000000||FieroMontreal||11-16-2001||11:24 PM||||Hey guys<BR>FieroMontreal is having a meeting Sunday November 18th... 6:30 pm is the time and Avenida Restaurant in Greenfield park is the location. If you plan to show please e-mail me so we can make reservations.. EVERYONE IS WELCOME even if you are from Out of town! Come on down people from Ontario! for more info check out <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieromontreal.com</A>  or email me at alex@fieromontreal.com<BR>Thanks<P>this will also be listed in the O/T forum.. please keep up..<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigfieromontreal_1.gif">  <BR>1986 Fiero GT, STOCK Wingless, <BR>-Alex President of FieroMontreal... <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieromontreal.com</A> <BR>and Regional Director of CFOG-I for Eastern Canada.||||reg||1
Z||000001||72vinman||11-17-2001||12:14 AM||||Alex, It is tough to make it out there at this time of the year. We should definitely try to plan something for the spring or summer of next year. It would be great to bring cars from both provinces together in one place. Maybe somewhere in the middle.<P>When I get some time we should look into this.<BR>By the way congratulations on your new position with CFOG-I.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigvin2_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroBUZZ||11-17-2001||08:51 AM||||Hey, Ottawa or Kingston would be in the middle.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Alex, congrats on your new position with CFOG-I.  Kind of short notice on the meet as I have something else on tap, tho.<P>Gary<BR>Almonte, Ont||||reg||14
Z||000003||longjonsilver||11-17-2001||12:27 PM||||Bonjour FieroMontreal:  longjonsilver in mascouche.  84 2m4 white  im the original owner - bot dec 10 1983 - anyone have one that is older????  just brought it from california - real clean - no rust, always garaged.  still have to get it licensed in quebec.  would love to come to a fiero run, but it would have to be in the daytime - my four year old would just HAVE to attend. this spring would be ideal for me - im not going to drive in the winter - no way!  next spring would be great! <BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroMontreal:<BR><B>Hey guys<BR>FieroMontreal is having a meeting Sunday November 18th... 6:30 pm is the time and Avenida Restaurant in Greenfield park is the location. If you plan to show please e-mail me so we can make reservations.. EVERYONE IS WELCOME even if you are from Out of town! Come on down people from Ontario! for more info check out <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieromontreal.com</A>  or email me at alex@fieromontreal.com<BR>Thanks<P>this will also be listed in the O/T forum.. please keep up..<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroMontreal||11-17-2001||01:46 PM||||Thanks for the Congrats guys!<P>I am planing a meeting somewhere in Ottawa for next summer. We were supposed to have one this past summer but the ottawa club that we were going to meet with cancelled 2 days before it was going to happen. It's good to know that there is interest out there!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>longjonsilver, I just e-mailed you with info on the club! Can't wait to hear from you.<P>------------------<BR> -Alex <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigfieromontreal_1.gif">   <BR>1986 Fiero GT, STOCK Wingless, <BR>President of FieroMontreal... <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieromontreal.com</A> <BR>and Regional Director of CFOG-I for Eastern Canada.||||reg||1
